      ],
      "definitions": [
        {
          "content": "Component indicating the equilibrium and/or the result. On an instrument with one position of equilibrium it indicates only the equilibrium (so-called zero). On an instrument with several positions of equilibrium it indicates both the equilibrium and the result. On an electronic instrument, this is the display."
        }
